# PACKAGE SUITES RED ON PROGRAM ITSELF, OWED: each still runs on every gate that reaches it, its words kept,
# and its failure is this line's debt rather than the gate's verdict. One a line: the package, its owner,
# its first failing line. A suite here that PASSES fails the gate until its line is struck, so the list only
# shrinks; a line with no owner fails too. Measured on program 225b3116 (lane-run 45939925006), the first
# run of the suites no slice had named.
